OL,3,GNEWSAFamily shares hidden cost of
OL,4,Acancer care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a teenage girl with a
OL,7,Frare form of childhood cancer say the
OL,8,Fhidden costs of caring for their
OL,9,Fdaughter have left them in fear of
OL,10,Flosing their home.
OL,12,FMaya, 13, from Hythe in Kent, was
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with neuroblastoma at three
OL,14,Fyears old, but relapsed in 2023 having
OL,15,Fbeen in remission for five years.
OL,17,FHer mother, Dellanie, said the pressure
OL,18,Fof paying a mortgage and bills whilst
OL,19,Fshe and her husband, Terry, are working
OL,20,Fless to care for Maya is continuing to
OL,21,Ftake its toll on their family of five.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
